<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>{{> layout/head-meta}}<title>신청한 행사 | Busan Play</title></head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
{{> layout/account-style}}
{{> layout/personal-account-style}}
<main class="personal-account-page history-page">
    <div class="account-layout">
        {{> layout/account-nav}}
        <div class="account-content">
            <header class="account-heading"><div><p class="account-location">마이페이지 / 내 활동</p><h1>신청한 행사</h1><p class="account-description">참가 확정·대기 중·종료된 행사 내역을 확인하세요.</p></div><a class="account-button account-button--secondary" href="/events/list">행사 둘러보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
            {{> user/history-content}}
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
{{> layout/footer}}
{{> registration/cancel-confirm-dialog}}
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('.format-point').forEach(element => {
    const value = Number(element.textContent.trim());
    if (Number.isFinite(value)) element.textContent = value.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + 'P';
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
